WEBVTT

00:19.820 --> 00:24.158
Tozasareta kioku no
naka no kizu ga

00:24.158 --> 00:28.696
Oto mo naku kokoro
ni fureru toki ni

00:28.696 --> 00:36.159
Yasashiku hohoemu sono ura
ni wa kodoku no namida

00:36.503 --> 00:41.408
Hateshinai tsuyosa motomete

00:41.408 --> 00:52.019
Shinjiru monotachi to
nando mo kakeagare

00:52.019 --> 00:54.388
Mamoritai

00:54.388 --> 00:56.557
Shinjitai

00:56.557 --> 01:00.794
Egao no wake wo subete

01:00.794 --> 01:05.165
Hageshisa mo itoshisa mo

01:05.165 --> 01:09.236
Zenbu uketomeru yo

01:09.236 --> 01:12.973
Nidoto sono te wo hanasanai

01:12.973 --> 01:21.540
Ano hikari wo mezashite...

01:30.557 --> 01:33.827
Previously on Shonen Onmyouji...

01:33.827 --> 01:36.130
I am...

01:36.130 --> 01:41.363
I'm the daughter of the man
you killed, Enoki Ryusai!

01:42.403 --> 01:47.238
That's the monster...
of the land of the dead.

01:48.242 --> 01:50.511
The monster of the
land of the dead?

01:50.511 --> 01:52.046
That's right.

01:52.046 --> 01:56.683
Touda was possessed by the
Soul Binding spell that I cast.

01:56.683 --> 01:59.186
Why?! Why did you do that
to Touda?

01:59.186 --> 02:03.953
Isn't it obvious?
My father was killed by Touda!

02:04.925 --> 02:12.297
That Seimei killed your father and
sent your mother to the underworld.

02:12.699 --> 02:14.462
Shut up!

02:17.704 --> 02:20.867
The Wind of Dusk,
the Eye of Dawn

02:21.708 --> 02:23.477
Why is it that...

02:23.477 --> 02:27.347
I don't have a father or mother?

02:27.347 --> 02:29.349
I've told you before...

02:29.349 --> 02:35.289
your mother was sent to the
underworld alive by Abe no Seimei...

02:35.289 --> 02:40.094
And your father was murdered by
Touda, one of Seimei's shikigami.

02:40.094 --> 02:42.129
But why?

02:42.129 --> 02:47.901
You must become stronger,
so you can fulfill your wishes.

02:47.901 --> 02:49.937
Become... stronger?

02:49.937 --> 02:55.307
If you don't grow stronger,
there's no point in your existence.

03:00.347 --> 03:02.781
I'm not scared...

03:03.317 --> 03:06.309
I'm not lonely either.

03:06.753 --> 03:08.956
I have to grow stronger...

03:08.956 --> 03:11.618
so I can protect my mother.

03:13.160 --> 03:15.185
Mo... ther...

03:26.206 --> 03:28.375
We'll be reaching
Izumo soon,

03:28.375 --> 03:30.605
so hang on a little longer!

03:41.788 --> 03:44.191
What exactly are you doing?

03:44.191 --> 03:46.625
Just making talismans.

03:47.027 --> 03:52.266
Seiryuu, are you
really going to kill Guren?

03:52.266 --> 03:55.202
He's committed
the same sin thrice.

03:55.202 --> 03:58.535
I don't see
any reason for mercy.

04:06.813 --> 04:08.610
Breathe!

04:14.454 --> 04:16.590
Are those shiki?

04:16.590 --> 04:20.424
What do you intend
to do with so many of them?

04:21.695 --> 04:24.186
My work here is done.

04:24.331 --> 04:27.596
Shall we be on our way too?

04:32.272 --> 04:33.296
Ouch!

04:34.007 --> 04:36.237
Masahiro, are you all right?

04:36.510 --> 04:39.179
Yes. Where are we?

04:39.179 --> 04:43.283
Izumo. I think
it's a place called Takanosan.

04:43.283 --> 04:46.186
Somewhere near this mountain,
there's supposed to be...

04:46.186 --> 04:50.057
a secret tunnel in the returning
path leading to the underworld.

04:50.057 --> 04:53.093
I can't see the path
we used before...

04:53.093 --> 04:55.796
and I can't sense its aura.

04:55.796 --> 04:58.865
Someone must have
cast a spell to obscure it.

04:58.865 --> 05:01.129
Chishiki no Guuji, perhaps?

05:02.436 --> 05:06.406
50 years ago, after attacking
the sacred sanctuary,

05:06.406 --> 05:10.444
Chishiki no Guuji probably
cast a spell to seal the cave.

05:10.444 --> 05:13.580
We thought that
the Miko of the returning path...

05:13.580 --> 05:16.383
had returned to protect the seal.

05:16.383 --> 05:20.547
But Chishiki no Guuji
was just trying to trick us.

05:20.687 --> 05:24.453
Whatever it is,
we have to find the cave fast!

05:24.591 --> 05:27.185
Taiin, we need you to
read the wind.

05:27.828 --> 05:30.030
The wind connects everything.

05:30.030 --> 05:33.433
If Kazane is somewhere
in the cave,

05:33.433 --> 05:36.630
you should be able to sense
her presence in the wind.

05:36.903 --> 05:39.167
I got it.
I'll give it a shot.

05:52.886 --> 05:56.790
Kai? You're still alive?

05:56.790 --> 05:59.054
Princess, I've awakened!

05:59.393 --> 06:02.863
Kai! You can talk?

06:02.863 --> 06:06.967
I can.
All this time I was under a spell.

06:06.967 --> 06:11.336
Now that I'm free of that head,
I can speak again.

06:14.975 --> 06:17.978
I'm so glad you're okay... Kai.

06:17.978 --> 06:22.783
If I ever lost you...
I would really be...

06:22.783 --> 06:24.774
Princess.

06:26.019 --> 06:28.954
The time has come.
Hurry, Princess!

06:29.122 --> 06:31.454
It's time you finally
learnt the truth.

06:32.259 --> 06:36.161
I'll show you what really
happened. Hurry, Princess!

06:40.834 --> 06:43.064
Wait, Kai!

06:45.205 --> 06:48.231
Master told me...

06:48.709 --> 06:51.200
Not to go in there!

07:28.014 --> 07:30.617
Mo... ther...

07:30.617 --> 07:32.608
Mother!

07:37.257 --> 07:39.326
How can this be?

07:39.326 --> 07:42.022
Weren't you trapped
in the land of the dead?

07:42.095 --> 07:45.966
Chishiki no Guuji
sealed the Miko.

07:45.966 --> 07:49.569
Only he can break the seal.

07:49.569 --> 07:55.041
your mother was sent to the
underworld alive by Abe no Seimei...

07:55.041 --> 07:58.636
Which is true?

07:58.845 --> 08:00.676
Mother!

08:00.747 --> 08:03.717
What should I believe?

08:03.717 --> 08:06.987
What a naughty girl
you are, Kazane.

08:06.987 --> 08:09.683
Didn't I tell you
never to come in here?

08:09.823 --> 08:11.425
Master!

08:11.425 --> 08:13.552
Chishiki no Guuji!

08:17.464 --> 08:19.455
Kai!

08:28.241 --> 08:30.232
Miko...

08:34.247 --> 08:37.978
The Miko of the returning path!
The Miko is mine!

08:38.618 --> 08:41.485
I gain the power!

08:41.855 --> 08:45.659
The power to rule heaven
and earth!

08:45.659 --> 08:48.423
Miko... My Miko!

08:48.628 --> 08:52.530
Miko! Miko!

08:54.568 --> 08:57.003
Don't be impatient, Ryusai.

08:57.003 --> 08:59.973
Soon my desires will be fulfilled.

08:59.973 --> 09:04.044
When that happens,
she'll be yours.

09:04.044 --> 09:08.014
This is my reward to you
for lending me your body.

09:08.014 --> 09:10.380
Master?

09:15.355 --> 09:19.257
As for you, I still need you
to do something for me.

09:22.462 --> 09:25.397
- Kazane...
- Taiin, what's wrong?

09:26.199 --> 09:28.759
Kazane's fallen into the
hands of Chishiki no Guuji!

09:28.969 --> 09:31.130
If we don't do something,
he'll kill her!

09:32.072 --> 09:34.199
Are we heading in the
right direction?

09:34.708 --> 09:38.075
I think so.
The wind's getting weaker.

09:38.278 --> 09:40.447
I'm sure this is all
Chishiki no Guuji's doing!

09:40.447 --> 09:44.110
Just follow the flow of the wind
before everything disappears!

09:45.151 --> 09:47.142
I'll try my best!

09:53.994 --> 09:55.929
The Chibiki rock.

09:55.929 --> 09:58.765
This is the first rock
that separates the land...

09:58.765 --> 10:01.700
from the sacred sanctuary
of the returning path.

10:01.768 --> 10:04.337
I'll have to use your powers...

10:04.337 --> 10:07.173
to break this seal, Kazane.

10:07.173 --> 10:11.578
Who exactly are you anyway?

10:11.578 --> 10:14.114
Chishiki no Guuji.

10:14.114 --> 10:16.116
I'm someone who wants to
destroy the human world...

10:16.116 --> 10:20.587
by harnessing the powers of
the land of the dead.

10:20.587 --> 10:24.455
And this body
is something I borrowed.

10:28.028 --> 10:32.089
My previous body was
destroyed by Abe no Seimei.

10:32.499 --> 10:37.436
But I transferred my soul
into another host to live.

10:38.204 --> 10:40.807
I moved my soul into
the body of...

10:40.807 --> 10:43.674
Enoki Ryusai who had
conveniently died then.

10:57.524 --> 10:59.993
What about my father...
and my mother?

10:59.993 --> 11:01.119
That's right.

11:01.261 --> 11:03.096
You're the daughter of...

11:03.096 --> 11:05.326
the deity of the returning path
and the Miko.

11:05.432 --> 11:07.701
So you're the one
who will inherit...

11:07.701 --> 11:10.135
the powers of the Miko.

11:10.437 --> 11:12.839
As for Enoki Ryusai,

11:12.839 --> 11:15.808
he is neither your father nor
is he related to you.

11:15.909 --> 11:18.011
He fell in love with
your mother,

11:18.011 --> 11:21.047
framed Abe no Seimei...

11:21.047 --> 11:24.851
and then killed by Touda
of the 12 shikigami.

11:24.851 --> 11:26.819
All that remained in
his body...

11:26.886 --> 11:30.845
was the obsession
he once held.

11:31.191 --> 11:34.354
You were dying to meet
your father, right?

11:47.207 --> 11:53.077
The one who killed
Enoki Ryusai was Touda.

11:53.513 --> 11:57.449
You believed he was your father,
but Ryusai is the one...

11:57.751 --> 12:01.915
who kidnapped your mother
from the sanctuary.

12:02.689 --> 12:04.824
You exacted your revenge
on Ryusai by...

12:04.824 --> 12:07.794
attacking Seimei and
sending Touda into the abyss.

12:07.794 --> 12:11.628
I have to say
you did a great job.

12:21.608 --> 12:22.870
What a fool!

12:23.109 --> 12:25.839
What a foolish girl!

12:25.979 --> 12:30.316
It's time to take off your seal.

12:30.316 --> 12:33.615
Then the power of
the Miko will be mine!

13:01.748 --> 13:05.741
I remember... I am...

13:06.086 --> 13:08.179
I... am!

13:08.354 --> 13:12.992
It's too late!
This is the only reason...

13:12.992 --> 13:15.984
I let you live so long, Kazane.

13:18.131 --> 13:20.567
The seal of the returning path...

13:20.567 --> 13:23.434
begone under the power
of the Miko!

13:29.909 --> 13:30.841
That's...

13:33.880 --> 13:37.714
I see it! That's the cave that
connects to the returning path.

13:40.620 --> 13:44.647
- The miasma from the underworld!
- He broke the first seal.

13:45.859 --> 13:50.228
- Miko!
- The guardian of the returning path.

13:50.597 --> 13:52.792
Looks like he sensed
something too.

13:55.769 --> 13:58.738
Up north.
It's just ahead, after the ridge!

13:58.805 --> 14:00.907
We're close!

14:00.907 --> 14:04.866
- We'll make it before sunset.
- Let's hurry!

14:10.183 --> 14:13.084
Finally, the first seal
has been broken!

14:13.253 --> 14:17.290
Now I need to break the
chibiki rock in the sanctuary,

14:17.290 --> 14:19.781
and this world will become
just like the underworld.

14:20.026 --> 14:23.096
Come to me...
Come to me.

14:23.096 --> 14:26.293
Like the wind that moves
in the land above.

14:32.639 --> 14:35.375
You've kept me
in such a confined space.

14:35.375 --> 14:40.146
You need to stay in the
miasma to retain your power.

14:40.146 --> 14:42.376
I had no choice.

14:43.149 --> 14:47.108
What a wind. It carries
the death of the underworld.

14:47.587 --> 14:51.956
At sunset, we'll present
your body as a sacrifice...

14:51.991 --> 14:56.690
- to open the last seal.
- I know.

15:05.004 --> 15:07.802
Mo... ther...

15:08.942 --> 15:10.933
We're on land!

15:12.011 --> 15:16.516
- We smell the living!
- It's food... we must feed!

15:16.516 --> 15:19.007
Demons from the underworld...

15:19.586 --> 15:22.316
I must have summoned them.

15:22.989 --> 15:26.857
Me, the daughter
of the Miko!

15:31.998 --> 15:33.488
Princess!

15:33.566 --> 15:36.269
I won't let you hurt my princess!

15:36.269 --> 15:38.760
Kai...

15:39.239 --> 15:42.936
Princess, you must survive.

15:53.419 --> 15:54.511
Princess...

16:03.129 --> 16:05.188
Kai...

16:08.935 --> 16:12.672
I have to tell someone...

16:12.672 --> 16:17.700
It's all my fault.
If only...

16:57.417 --> 16:59.681
Rikugou!

17:04.424 --> 17:07.689
[chant]

17:08.328 --> 17:10.296
Take this!

17:11.831 --> 17:14.968
- Wave Shield!
- That's Seimei's...

17:14.968 --> 17:19.405
successor and his shikigami...

17:24.877 --> 17:27.641
- Kazane!
- Shatter!

17:35.955 --> 17:39.413
Is she okay?
This is bad!

17:40.660 --> 17:47.065
Touda's... already...
reached the seal...

17:48.101 --> 17:51.730
- Rikugou can handle this.
- Let's go, Masahiro!

17:54.474 --> 17:56.465
Rikugou, take care of her!

17:59.779 --> 18:04.148
I've done something unforgivable.

18:04.183 --> 18:05.616
Don't speak.

18:06.119 --> 18:08.587
I'm very sorry!

18:09.255 --> 18:12.058
But now, it's too late.

18:12.058 --> 18:15.494
Kazane, it's okay. Say no more.

18:15.862 --> 18:20.266
This is my retribution...

18:20.266 --> 18:25.294
I was too foolish.

18:30.376 --> 18:36.144
I should have trusted you
then... Rikugou!

18:36.649 --> 18:40.517
- It's Saiki.
- Saiki...

18:40.920 --> 18:44.157
Saiki. No one else knows this...

18:44.157 --> 18:46.352
It's my real name.

18:46.426 --> 18:49.088
- Saiki.
- Yes.

18:50.430 --> 18:53.866
I don't want to be
alone anymore.

18:54.934 --> 18:57.698
Can I stay with you?

18:59.639 --> 19:01.607
Stay by my side.

19:02.675 --> 19:05.542
Saiki...

19:26.532 --> 19:30.436
- So they have come.
- How annoying.

19:30.436 --> 19:32.839
Ignore them, just proceed.

19:32.839 --> 19:35.399
I'll take care of them.

19:42.915 --> 19:48.751
- Grandfather!
- Looks like we made it in time.

19:49.455 --> 19:51.791
What happened to Rikugou?

19:51.791 --> 19:56.125
Back at the mountains...
Kazane was attacked...

19:57.663 --> 20:00.131
- I see.
- Seimei!

20:00.566 --> 20:04.093
Is it true that Touda
will never return to us?

20:07.039 --> 20:10.634
I heard Chishiki no Guuji's
voice in the wind.

20:10.877 --> 20:16.247
If this continues, Touda
and Kazane will be lost forever!

20:19.652 --> 20:21.711
I can only
tell you one thing.

20:22.188 --> 20:26.826
Regardless of all that
has transpired between us,

20:26.826 --> 20:30.728
Guren will always be
my friend. Always.

21:10.870 --> 21:14.362
It's been a while,
Abe no Seimei.

21:14.540 --> 21:16.531
Ryusai!

21:42.868 --> 21:53.836
Toki to shite hito wa dare mo
Yume wo miushinatte shimau

21:54.347 --> 22:05.417
Ayamachi ya kizutsukikata mo
Jidai wa kurikaesarete iku

22:05.691 --> 22:10.924
Doushite shinjiau koto ni aragauno?

22:11.397 --> 22:16.630
Doushite unmei to iu hikari kesuno?

22:19.272 --> 22:29.515
Bokutachi no mirai wa
Kono te de mamori nukitai

22:29.515 --> 22:36.422
Zenryoku de idomukoto no imi wo

22:36.422 --> 22:41.560
Kimi ga oshietekureta kara

22:41.560 --> 22:47.433
Motto motto kimi wa kimi o koete

22:47.433 --> 22:54.430
Kitto kitto kitto

23:00.613 --> 23:02.911
Next Episode

23:23.869 --> 23:25.638
Next on Shonen Onmyouji...

23:25.638 --> 23:27.128
Episode 25.

23:27.306 --> 23:29.740
Episode 25
Dancing Junipers in the
Whirl of Miasma
Dancing Junipers in the
Whirl of Miasma.
